Introduce the claweval-runner (ce-runner) package under src/benchmark/, orchestrating claw-eval evaluation tasks through the openclaw agent.

It runs the agent in isolated Docker sandboxes, converts sessions to traces, and performs LLM-judge grading, with single-task and parallel batch runners plus an idempotent end-to-end environment setup.

